  "scope": "C349 changes Csv::field interface only: return ordinary fullwidth string_view and write decoded bytecount through optional caller-owned size_t pointer, replacing32byte aggregate return with unused escaped member. Rawview/decodedview/scratch/doubledquotes/unquoted/BOM/EOF/terminator/count algorithm untouched. Readername+note each have independent localfullwidth counters; hash/canonicalencodedrawname/event get sameview, noteview discarded; no new pointer lifetime or narrowed integer/field domain. Header/tail callers need nocount and pass defaultnullptr. Intended reduce aggregate-return stores/hiddenreturn ABIcost, subject to actualinlining/optimization; no measuredGCCpath/causality or target gain yet. Original nameowner table/private512SPSC queues/roles12/numeric/group/PGO/flags unchanged. No catalogue/seed/outputcache/host/harness/timer/counter/tunable/exemption changes. Fresh actualCsv field differential decoded/raw/count/guard/fullbyte/escape/long/unquoted/header/malformed/model, currentmain independent/adversarial/untrained/strict/race/pinnedGCC/image/default/Make proof needed before promotion.",
